# Stage 10 — A/B experiments, spending, caching.
# Run: `npm run dev` + `npm run worker:dev` + Redis; ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set for the worker.
# Each experiment input costs 3 Claude calls (A, B, judge).
@base = http://localhost:3000

# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.local", "password": "password123" }

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Prompt A
# @name a
POST {{base}}/api/prompts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "title": "Ticket summary (detailed)", "content": "Summarise this customer support ticket for an agent: {{ticket}}" }

### Prompt B
# @name b
POST {{base}}/api/prompts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "title": "Ticket summary (one line)", "content": "In ONE sentence of at most 20 words, state the customer's problem and what they want. Ticket: {{ticket}}" }

### Run the A/B experiment → 202
# @name exp
POST {{base}}/api/experiments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Detailed vs one-line ticket summaries",
  "promptAId": "{{a.response.body.id}}",
  "promptBId": "{{b.response.body.id}}",
  "inputs": [
    { "ticket": "I ordered a blue jacket on May 3rd, order #4411. It still hasn't arrived and tracking hasn't updated in a week. Please send a replacement or refund." },
    { "ticket": "The app logs me out every time I switch to another app. iPhone 15, latest version. Really annoying, please fix." },
    { "ticket": "I was charged twice for my March subscription ($12.99 x2). I need one charge refunded." },
    { "ticket": "Can I change the delivery address on order #5520? I'm moving next week." },
    { "ticket": "Your coupon SPRING20 says invalid at checkout but the email says it's valid until the 30th." },
    { "ticket": "The size chart says M fits chest 96-100cm but the M shirt I got is much smaller. Want to exchange for L." }
  ]
}

### Poll: status, per-input outputs, judgments and the statistical summary
GET {{base}}{{exp.response.body.statusUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My experiments
GET {{base}}/api/experiments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### What have I spent this month? (by model, operation and day, plus budget left)
GET {{base}}/api/usage/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: spend per user
GET {{base}}/api/usage/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: set bob's monthly budget to $2
PATCH {{base}}/api/users/bob
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "monthlyBudgetUsd": 2 }

### Cache: read the same prompt twice, then compare cache hits/misses
GET {{base}}/api/prompts/{{a.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/metrics
